{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>And they shall go up and come, etc., and in your servants' houses and in your people</b> — behold, he placed servants before people. And afterward it is written: ובכה ובעמך ובכל עבדיך, and that is the reason: when they were stricken in their bodies, as we expound from ובכה — that they would bang in their bodies — then he and the people were stricken first, for they were in the counsel, as it is written: ויאמר אל עמו, and afterward their servants. But when they went up, they entered first into his house and his servants' houses, and afterward into his people."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:11.442168545Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}